diff --git a/doc/changes/dev/14312.bugfix.rst b/doc/changes/dev/14312.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..87d66946a4d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14312.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix bug where :func:`mne.preprocessing.oversampled_temporal_projection` and :func:`mne.preprocessing.maxwell_filter` with ``st_overlap=True`` could fail the constant overlap-add (COLA) check when the window had an odd number of samples, and adjust non-COLA windows to the closest COLA window when SciPy 1.16+ is installed, by `Eric Larson`_.
